# AI service runtime state (ai/features/data/): zones, calibration, and the
# two face galleries. Per-deployment, not code -- and the galleries are
# biometric data tied to named real people, so committing them is
# effectively permanent.
ai/features/data/*
!ai/features/data/.gitkeep

